@startuml View Class Details by Admin
actor Admin
participant ": ClassManagementPage " as ClassManagementPage
participant ": ClassDetailPage " as ClassDetailPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ClassGroupController " as ClassGroupController
participant ": ClassGroupService " as ClassGroupService
participant ": ClassGroupRepository " as ClassGroupRepository
database Database

Admin->ClassManagementPage: 1. Click on a class to view details
    activate Admin
    activate ClassManagementPage

ClassManagementPage->ClassDetailPage: 2. Navigate to /admin/classes/{id}
    deactivate ClassManagementPage
    activate ClassDetailPage

ClassDetailPage->ClassDetailPage: 3. Render Class Detail Page

ClassDetailPage->Router: 4. Send GET /api/classgroup/{id}/detail
    deactivate ClassDetailPage
    activate Router

Router->ClassGroupController: 5. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate ClassGroupController

ClassGroupController->ClassGroupService: 6. GetDetailByIdAsync(id)
    deactivate ClassGroupController
    activate ClassGroupService

ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 7. GetByIdAsync(id)
    activate ClassGroupRepository

ClassGroupRepository->Database: 8. Query ClassGroup by Id with relations
    activate Database

Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 9. Return ClassGroup Data
    deactivate Database

ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 10. Return ClassGroup Details
    deactivate ClassGroupRepository

ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 11. GetHomeroomTeacherAsync(id)
    activate ClassGroupRepository

ClassGroupRepository->Database: 12. Query HomeroomTeacher by ClassGroupId
    activate Database

Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 13. Return Teacher or null
    deactivate Database

ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 14. Return HomeroomTeacher
    deactivate ClassGroupRepository

ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 15. Create ClassGroupDetailDto

ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: 16. Return ClassGroupDetailDto
    activate ClassGroupController
    deactivate ClassGroupService

ClassGroupController-->Router: 17. Send Class Details Response
    activate Router
    deactivate ClassGroupController

Router-->ClassDetailPage: 18. Display Class Details
    activate ClassDetailPage
    deactivate Router

ClassDetailPage->ClassDetailPage: 19. Render Class Information

ClassDetailPage-->Admin: 20. Show Complete Class Details
    deactivate ClassDetailPage
    deactivate Admin
@enduml
